WEBVTT

00:02.500 --> 00:05.673
Enable Realtime in the settings of a
supported provider.

00:06.099 --> 00:07.918
Now words appear while you speak,

00:08.021 --> 00:10.304
instead of waiting until the
recording ends.

00:11.167 --> 00:13.417
Please check the mobile layout by
Friday.

00:14.830 --> 00:16.623
Tap the microphone to finish.

00:18.068 --> 00:21.564
Realtime availability and behavior
depend on the provider

00:21.641 --> 00:22.699
you choose.
